  (text "USB D- = GPIO18 (pin 13); D+ = GPIO19 (pin 14).\nNo UART bridge. Unused GPIOs deliberately marked NC.\nKeep antenna clear; bond EP pin 19 and pin 9 to ground.\nUse ADC1 GPIO0 for battery sensing (not ADC2)."
