    (uuid ef6b3a0c-8f93-5ee4-aec1-0eaab9f5c713)
  )
  (text "VBAT_ADC = VBAT / 2, max ~2.15 V incl. tolerances.\nADC1 GPIO0: use calibrated 11/12 dB attenuation.\nDivider load ~4.5 uA; allow >=120 ms to settle.\n\nUSB_PRESENT_N: GPIO1 LOW when VBUS is present.\nFirmware must disable USB attach when VBUS is absent.\nQ2 isolates 5 V VBUS from the 3.3 V GPIO supply."
    (at 279.4 203.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid 242c3add-6e7f-5079-9531-b33fbacfc318)
  )
  (text "DRAFT / before PCB:\nConfirm protected battery and JST polarity.\nValidate USB current, inrush, suspend and ESD.\nVerify regulator layout, capacitor bias and load steps.\nReference: Olimex ESP32-C3-DevKit-Lipo Rev C.\nSee docs/power-design.md for sources and limits."
    (at 279.4 242.57 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid 8c3c3291-f167-554d-b6fd-6b63d98a58dd)
  )
